<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2941] Add getOrStart method to ignition</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2941</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently there is no way to atomically check if an Ignite instance with the given name is started and start it, if it was not started.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12955410">IGNITE-2941</key>
            <summary>Add getOrStart method to ignition</summary>
