                            <comment id="15231687" author="dmagda" created="Fri, 8 Apr 2016 06:01:45 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Probably we should add boolean parameter like &lt;tt&gt;failIfStarted&lt;/tt&gt; to &lt;tt&gt;IgnitionEx.start0()&lt;/tt&gt;. If the flag is true (default) then everything will work as presently. Otherwise an existed (old) instance should be returned.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Tests has to be added as well to validate the functionality.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
